    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Depth of Mind</strong> is a tactical roguelike where you lead a team of mental operatives into the fractured consciousness of a critical subject. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run consists of risky and thoughtful decisions.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711100/extras/9c72458c2e974f45e8551dcf630605c8.poster.avif?t=1754930917\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711100/extras/9c72458c2e974f45e8551dcf630605c8.gif?t=1754930917\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711100/extras/4467b61c786b228f0bf98a10288a8adf.poster.avif?t=1754930917\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711100/extras/4467b61c786b228f0bf98a10288a8adf.apng?t=1754930917\" class=\"bb_img\" width=596 height=300 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711100/extras/77f794f9428fef37c77ca4508f947d84.poster.avif?t=1754930917\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711100/extras/77f794f9428fef37c77ca4508f947d84.apng?t=1754930917\" class=\"bb_img\" width=579 height=197 /></picture></span></p>",
